' flowcast source: flowcast 합성 예제 (sequence). Linux 7.0.14 (Docker Desktop linuxkit, arm64), glibc 2.41에서 ext4 파일을 read()한 ftrace 기록(function tracer, func_stack_trace, sched와 block 이벤트)과 glibc read 역어셈블, upstream stable v7.0.14 소스 arch/arm64/kernel/syscall.c, fs/read_write.c, mm/filemap.c 기준
box "사용자 공간 (EL0)"
  participant "앱\nreadprobe" as app
  participant "glibc 2.41\nread 래퍼" as libc
end box
box "커널 (EL1)"
  participant "arm64 진입\nel0_svc" as entry
  participant "VFS\nvfs_read" as vfs
  participant "ext4, 페이지 캐시\nfilemap_read" as fs
  participant "블록 계층\nvirtio-blk" as blk
end box
participant "가상 디스크\nDocker VM" as dev

app -> libc : 1. read(99, buf, 16)
libc -> entry : 2. x8 = 63, svc #0
entry -> entry : 3. invoke_syscall → __arm64_sys_read\n→ ksys_read
entry -> entry : 4. fdget_pos(99): 열린 파일 없음\nvfs_read는 호출되지 않음
entry -> entry : 5. x0 = -9 (-EBADF)\nraw_syscalls sys_exit: NR 63 = -9
entry --> libc : 6. eret, x0 = -9
libc -> libc : 7. x0가 -4095~-1이므로\nerrno = 9, x0 = -1
libc --> app : 8. -1 (errno 9, Bad file descriptor)
@enduml
